<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">We’ve received
your request for temporary loan modification due to the Covid-19 pandemic. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">We understand
these are extremely difficult times and small businesses have been hit
especially hard. To expedite your request, please provide the following
documents:<o:p></o:p></span></p><div style=""><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"></p><ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><li><font face="Arial, sans-serif">March bank statements</font></li><li><font face="Arial, sans-serif">April month to date bank transaction history</font></li></ul><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">For faster processing, please answer the following:</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"></p><ul style=""><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">What payment assistance are you looking for?</font></li><ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><li style="font-family: arial;">i.e.
      partial or 50% payments, etc.</li></ul><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">When will you be able to resume payment?&nbsp;</font></li><ul style=""><li style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Please provide a date or estimated date</font></li></ul></ul><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Please reply to this email with all the requested information and attachments. Once received, our team will review and a credit manager will respond as soon as possible*. We wish you and your family the best during this difficult time. Visit our site for updates and support for our customers: <a href="https://www.nationalfunding.com/SBAloans">https://www.nationalfunding.com/SBAloans</a></font></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><br></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;">Thank you,&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><br></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style=""><font face="arial">Loan Modification Team&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><b><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">National Funding, Inc.,&nbsp;the parent and servicing&nbsp;company of&nbsp;</span></b><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><div><b style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Quick Bridge Funding, LLC</span></b></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial;">9820 Towne Centre Drive</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">San Diego, CA 92121</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt;
color:red">*To ensure your request is processed in a timely manner:</span></b><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

